[Music]  the be active local hero award  recognizes and celebrates individual  achievements that encourage others to be  active  alolog the winner of the 2021 award  perfectly embodies the be active spirit  having been a promoter of physical  activity throughout estonia for years  aloe has taken on the challenge of  making movement and being active a  natural part of the daily routine for  all estonians promoting movement as a  lifestyle aloe created a new initiative  for indoor health trails within  buildings in 2015.  the idea was simple if people spend much  of the day indoors we should give them  opportunities to move and be active  there  the initiative has grown immensely since  with over 130 health trails encouraging  over 100 000 people every day to engage  in indoor exercise be it in corporate  offices schools or universities  aloe's indoor health trails make clever  use of stairs corridors and courtyards  to encourage people of all ages to move  and be active  aloe's impact goes beyond the indoors  his estonian health trail foundation  oversees a network of 122 outdoor trails  across estonia with over 1 100  kilometers of trails for running biking  and skiing  with more than 6 million visits a year  the trails contribute to a healthier  happier and more active estonian society  the impact of indoor and outdoor health  stay is that we are really close to  people all the time that's the key how  we make  moving as a lifestyle to all estonians  i think benefits of being active on  daily basis it makes us all stronger  happier better people and if we are  healthy and happy then we have more  healthy ears and that's all we need  [Music]  you

